  m_text: "\rComplete 3 burger orders within 3 minutes \r\n\r\n-Move around the kitchen as quickly as you can\r\n-Interact with the floating ingredients to meet your angry enemy ingredient \r\n-Defeat all 3 angry enemy ingredients to build your burger \r\n-Deliver the delicious burger to the customer \r\n\r\nDefeat the ingredients and get the burger orders in on time or else! \r\n\r\nKEYS:\r\n[WASD] Move\r\n[SPACE] Fight\r\n[E] Interact"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
